  "locale": "en",
  "title": "The Parachute Jump",
  "kind": "joke",
  "v": 2,
  "location": "samolet",
  "place": "plane",
  "cast": [
    "sluzhivy",
    "sluzhivy-ryadovoy",
    "paren"
  ],
  "roles": {
    "sluzhivy-ryadovoy": "soldier",
    "paren": "soldier",
    "sluzhivy": "officer"
  },
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "l1",
      "character": "narrator",
      "text": "The instructor shouts over the roar of the engines.",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.3
    },
    {
      "id": "l2",
      "character": "sluzhivy",
      "text": "Right, you two!",
      "emotion": "angry",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "id": "l3",
      "character": "sluzhivy",
      "text": "Parachutes on, we're over the target zone, steer for the red X, and a truck will be waiting there to take you back to the barracks.",
      "emotion": "angry",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.3
    },
    {
      "id": "l4",
      "character": "sluzhivy",
      "text": "And three, two, one – go!",
      "emotion": "angry",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.4
    },
    {
      "id": "l5",
      "character": "narrator",
      "text": "They jump out and fall for a bit.",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.3
    },
    {
      "id": "l6",
      "character": "narrator",
      "text": "The first one pulls his cord, nothing. The second one pulls his, nothing.",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.3
    },
    {
      "id": "l7",
      "character": "narrator",
      "text": "So they float along, and then one of them says:",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "id": "l8",
      "character": "sluzhivy-ryadovoy",
      "text": "There's still the emergency cord, I think.",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.3
    },
    {
      "id": "l9",
      "character": "narrator",
      "text": "He pulls it, the other one too, nothing.",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.4
    },
    {
      "id": "l10",
      "character": "sluzhivy-ryadovoy",
      "text": "You know, it's a real crap outfit, the army.",
      "uncensored": "You know, it's a real shit outfit, the army.",
      "emotion": "sad",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.3
    },
    {
      "id": "l11",
      "character": "paren",
      "text": "I think so too.",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.6
    },
    {
      "id": "l12",
      "character": "paren",
      "text": "And you know what? I bet the truck won't be there either.",
      "emotion": "smug",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.8,
      "laugh": "big"
    }
  ],
